      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently the min height seems to be 0.1m. Anything below that clamps to 0.1m on remote players unless you use bunch of carefully configured scale constraints to bypass that (which also breaks other things like GoGoLoco float).\n\nRelated bug reports:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1319-uploaded-avatars-not-height-clamped\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/avatars-between-1-10cm-are-not-replicated-correctly",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
