  "details": "If the users view point is above 100 Meters or below 0.2 Meters remote players will see their Avatars height clamped to those min max values.\n\nThis affects avatars and setting the users height in world outside the stated limits above.\n\nImage provided shows the top user scaled to 200 Meters. locally has their avatar properly scaled with their feet touching the ground. for the second user at the bottom they see the user floating in the air with their avatar scaled as if their view point was 100 Meters.",
